### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 93/100.** Evidence Terminal-Bench 2.1: 88.8% SOTA; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 90/100.** Evidence AA Coding Agent Index 80 #1; FrontierMath 95%+ lineage; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 96/100.** 1M / 128K out — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 55/100.** Text, image in; text out; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 94/100.** Evidence AA Coding Agent Index 80, Terminal-Bench 2.1 88.8%, DeepSWE SOTA; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 40/100.** Paid $5/$30 per 1M (flagship; $0.55/task via AA).
- **Overall Score: 86/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (93+90+96+55+94)/5=85.6 → 86; best-fit per scoring methodology.

